# PWG→RU lane config — ONE place to point profiles (MG 24-08-2026).
#
# Copy to RussianTranslation/.env (gitignored) or set real env vars.
# Real environment ALWAYS beats this file; explicit CLI flags and bound
# manifest-v2 execution.profile_slot beat both — this only fills DEFAULTS.

# Active profile slot, one lane at a time:
#   PWG_PROFILE_SLOT=c1
# Legacy alias also read by window_reports.resolve_profile (do not set both):
#   PWG_PROFILE=c1
#
# Multi-account later — two supported shapes, no code edits either way:
#   one at a time   -> flip PWG_PROFILE_SLOT (probe default + scheduler rotate)
#   both together   -> run two processes, each exporting its own PWG_PROFILE_SLOT;
#                      per-fingerprint ActiveCallClaim serialises each lane
# Full scheduler roster order override (comma list):
#   PWG_PROFILE_ROSTER=c1,c4,c5,c6
# Non-default .env location:
#   PWG_ENV_FILE=D:\path\to\lane.env

# Consumers wired today: h963_c4_gate0_probe.py (--account default),
# nonstop_scheduler.py (effective_roster). Unset = historical behaviour
# (probe fallback c4; R5.1 roster c4,c1,c5,c6).

# --- Wave-1 provider canary credentials (H3714) ---
# Never commit a value. Set these as real environment variables (or in the
# gitignored RussianTranslation/.env) only for a bounded, non-promotable canary.
#   xAI console      -> https://console.x.ai/  (API keys)
#   DeepSeek console -> https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
XAI_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
